.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
This class implements the stemming algorithm defined by a snowball script\&.
Generated from spanish\&.sbl by Snowball 3\&.0\&.1 - https://snowballstem\&.org/

.fi
.PP
 
